  [ 14] pushproplist ............................ <[:]>
  [ 15] setprop 8 ............................... modes = [:]
  [ 17] getparam 0 .............................. <me>
  [ 19] pusharglistnoret 1 ...................... <me>
  [ 21] extcall 9 ............................... return me
  [ 23] ret
end

on init me
  [  0] pushsymb 12 ............................. <#comic>
