end

on setMode me, sym, data, revert
  [  0] getprop 8 ............................... <modes>
  [  2] getparam 1 .............................. <sym>
  [  4] pusharglist 2 ........................... <modes, sym>
  [  6] objcall 31 .............................. <modes[sym]>
